      "stop_reason": "end_turn",
      "tool_uses": [],
      "assistant_text": "According to [[credential-scoping]], the Anthropic API key is **injected into the environment of the spawned child process** (for both the Ingest and Query agents), immediately before that process starts.\n\nThe key detail is that the Hub process itself never holds the API key in its own environment. Instead, a local secrets loader reads the key from a git-ignored \u0060.env\u0060 file at startup and injects it only into the child process\u0027s environment. This means the Hub\u0027s process environment is never mutated, preventing a compromised Hub from leaking the credential simply by inspecting its own environment variables.",
